<c>[Dialog]
<c>->  [F3·Equalizer]

Press F3 or click on the tab-label (when the Dialog is open) to select this Tab.

Use ArrowUp and ArrowDown to select an Equalizer-set.
Use the "Activate sel" command to activate and apply the selected Equalizer-set.
Use Alt+ArrowUp and Alt+ArrowDown to select a frequency.
Use Alt+ArrowLeft and Alt+ArrowRight to change the gain's value.

There are 20 Equalizer-sets. Each set has 10 frequencies.
The first 3 sets are initially flat. The values and names of the others are
copied from VLC.

(There is a vertical graphical representation of the equalizer-set instead of
the horizontal one)